NEW: ARP / SEQ, an arpeggiator and step sequencer inspired by classic analog hardware, next to the Looper.
- ARP: hold a chord and it plays the notes in turn (as played, up/down or shuffled) over up to 2 extra octaves
- SEQ: record up to 256 steps with rests and ties into 3 patterns, then play them from any key
- HOLD, TAP tempo, triplets, GATE knob
- Saved with your presets

ALSO
- Smoother on older phones
- Looper stops properly when switched off
- Reverb SHIMMER is now AIR
